Dimension: Performance
Severity: Minor
Location: mcp/common/src/main/java/org/springframework/ai/mcp/McpToolUtils.java::288
Title: Frequent ObjectMapper usage in hot path
Description: The method is called within the tool execution lifecycle. Creating a new tree model via `readTree` for every tool result parsing may incur unnecessary overhead for high-throughput proxied systems.
Assumption: This code will be executed in a high-concurrency or performance-sensitive environment.

